{"results":[{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/shreeji-eternity","title":"Shreeji Eternity In Malad West | Buy 2 & 3 BHK, 2 BHK WITH DECK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Malad West](/buy/mumbai/malad-west-1a256b7a91)\n\n>\n\nShreeji Group\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-group-shreeji-eternity-bedroom-1753787593.jpg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-group-shreeji-eternity-elevation-1740484093.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-group-shreeji-eternity-elevation-1740484165.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-group-shreeji-eternity-elevation-1740484191.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-group-shreeji-eternity-elevation-1740484233.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/060722053222-NewProject(93).png)\n\n# Shreeji Eternity\n\nShreeji Eternity Experience Centre, Shreeji Eternity, New Link Rd, Near Zenith Hospital, Malad, Orlem, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra-400064\n\nMalad West\n\n₹1.68 Cr - 4.03 Cr\n\n₹1.68 Cr - 4.03 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nPresenting Shreeji Eternity by Shreeji Group, an ultra-modern residential project offering spacious 2 & 3 BHK luxury Homes with private decks, thoughtfully designed for a lifestyle that’s Eternal, Infinite, and Inclusive. Nestled in a prime location, this premium development boasts 4 levels of podium parking and over 30,000+ sq. ft. of world-class lifestyle amenities on the 5th podium level, ensuring you live a life of unmatched grandeur. Every home at Shreeji Eternity is a masterpiece of design and detail, meticulously curated with the finest specifications, refined aesthetics, and unparalleled functionality. From peaceful residential surroundings to excellent connectivity, this address offers proximity to educational institutions, healthcare facilities, shopping centers, and entertainment hubs, making it a perfect blend of convenience and elegance. Whether you're a homebuyer or a real estate investor, Shreeji Eternity promises timeless value and a truly elevated living experience.\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nUnder construction\n\nPossession in Jun 2027\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹31,054/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n540 - 1217 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* 20 Plus Amenities.\n* Open space for recreational Activities.\n* 3 level of Podium Parking & Podium Amenities\n\n* Balcony residencies with sky View.\n* Prime Location with Best Connectivity.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nShreeji Eternity is generally regarded as a well-located under-construction project that balances modern luxury with urban connectivity. Reviews highlight the project's strategic position near the Valnai-Meeth Chowky Metro Station and the variety of lifestyle amenities planned. However, some feedback mentions concerns regarding the current local environment, such as road quality and the typical density of the Orlem-Link Road area. +1\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nStrategic Location\n\nThe project is situated directly on New Link Road, offering excellent connectivity to the Western Express Highway and SV Road.\n\nMetro Connectivity\n\nResidents benefit from being within a 5-minute walking distance of the Valnai-Meeth Chowky Metro Station.\n\nProximity to Social Infrastructure\n\nLeading educational institutions like Ryan International and Billabong High, and major malls like Infiniti and Inorbit, are in the immediate vicinity.\n\nModern Amenities\n\nThe development includes over 30,000 sq. ft. of lifestyle facilities, such as a gymnasium, sky-deck balconies, and a dedicated wellness club.\n\nEfficient Layouts\n\nFloor plans are frequently described as smartly designed with zero space wastage and Vaastu compliance.\n\nCommercial Convenience\n\nThe inclusion of a ground-level commercial podium provides residents with seamless access to daily shopping needs.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nTraffic Congestion\n\nThe surrounding New Link Road and Meeth Chowky junction are prone to severe traffic bottlenecks during peak hours.\n\nUnder-Construction Nuisance\n\nAs a developing site, current visitors note road issues like potholes and dust pollution in the immediate surroundings.\n\nHigh Pricing\n\nSome reviewers consider the property prices to be on the higher side or over-hyped compared to the local market average.\n\nLimited Open Space\n\nBeing a single-tower high-rise on a 0.76-acre plot, there is restricted ground-level open space compared to larger townships.\n\nParking Constraints\n\nCurrent reviews mention a scarcity of parking spaces in the neighborhood, though the project promises multi-level podium parking upon completion.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nExcellent for commuters\n\nPremium lifestyle choice\n\nHigh investment potential\n\nBusy urban living\n\nBest for families seeking luxury amenities\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndo