carpet area range of Shreeji Eternity?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Shreeji Eternity is 540 - 1217 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Shreeji Eternity?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Shreeji Eternity is ₹1.68 Cr - 4.03 Cr\n\n### Where is Shreeji Eternity located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nShreeji Eternity is located at Shreeji Eternity Experience Centre, Shreeji Eternity, New Link Rd, Near Zenith Hospital, Malad, Orlem, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra-400064.\n\n### What configurations are available in Shreeji Eternity?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nShreeji Eternity has 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Shreeji Eternity?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Shreeji Eternity is Under construction.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Shreeji Eternity?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Multipurpose Hall, Reflexology, Snooker / Billiards, Spa, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Shreeji Eternity?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Shreeji Eternity is Shreeji Group.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Shreeji Eternity:Shreeji Group](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/060722053222-NewProject(93).png)\n\n## Shreeji Group\n\nShreeji Construction, an esteemed real estate developer founded in 2001, specialises in creating residential, commercial, and retail properties. The company is led by a team of conscientious and committed professionals who prioritise comprehending the explicit and implicit demands of their customers and tailoring their projects accordingly. Collaborating with Siddharth Enterprises, Shreeji Construction strives to deliver projects of the utmost quality that offer exceptional value to its customers.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/polo-infra-developers-polo-matrix-elevation-1788606318.webp)\n\n![Polo Matrix](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/031023045019-newproject-22.webp)\n\nPolo Matrix\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.62 Cr - 2.33 Cr\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/hs-group-downtown-liberty-one-elevation-1788604964.webp)\n\n![Downtown Liberty One](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/220122014710-2.png)\n\nDowntown Liberty One\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹2.04 Cr\n\n2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/urjha-realty-urjha-liberty-heights-elevation-1783081173.webp)\n\n![Urjha Liberty Heights](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/030726050801-images-15-1.webp)\n\nUrjha Liberty Heights\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.31 Cr - 2.18 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/runwal-realty-runwal-auris-elevation-1770099228.jpg)\n\n![Runwal Auris](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/281025123533-blob624ee0f6-1d0a-4d57-a063-52f1ef0e53bf.webp)\n\nRunwal Auris\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹5.07 Cr - 7.8 Cr\n\n3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![arrow-left-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-left-swiper.svg)\n\n![arrow-right-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-right-swiper.svg)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/i