ternity\n\n## Shreeji Eternity Photos & Videos\n\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 1](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 1\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 2](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 2\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 3](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 3\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 4](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 4\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 5](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 5\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 6](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 6\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 7](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 7\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 8](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 8\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 9](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 9\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 10](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 10\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 11](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 11\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 12](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 12\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 13](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 13\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photos 14](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photos 14\")\n\n## About [Malad West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Malad-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Malad West Video](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Malad West Video\")\n\n## About Shreeji Construction\n\n![Shreeji Construction](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Construction\")\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| The Shreeji Group, since 2001, is a premier real estate development company that focuses on multi family residential, SRA and redevelopment projects. With the primary business being the development of properties in residential, commercial and retail sectors, the companys operations span across various aspects of real estate development, such as Land Identification and Acquisition, Project Planning, Designing, Marketing and Execution, Property Services and Estate Management.    The company believes in creating a home or an office based on an understanding of the stated and unstated consumer needs and preferences. The company develops every property only after a concentrated and focused market research to determine the consumer needs and then the project is designed and implemented according to consumer preferences. with a remarkably versatile profile. The groups activities comprise developing, building and managing properties. In addition, the group also offers a wide range of allied services, for individuals and companies.    The group has left its imprint of excellence across the Mumbai Metropolitan Region, in the form of some iconic projects.    More than a business venture, the Shreeji Group is a coming together of ethically inclined professionals, with an abiding commitment towards delivering value, to their customers and stakeholders.    This convergence of diverse proficiencies, supported by moral values, has resulted in a unique people-centric business philosophy. Be it consumers, associates, institutions or its employees, Shreeji Group is focused on people and their welfare.    The core values of the group thus comprise innovation, design excellence, timeliness, fair business practices and commitment towards the environment. Above all the group realizes that, its activities can result in better and happy communities.    The Shreeji Group therefore ensures that, consumer preferences are taken into account, while designing and developing properties. As a natural consequence, architectural designs are customized, to suit a location and enhance functionality and beauty. The group also places an emphasis on ergonomics, structural durability and strategic position of a site.    Shreejis people-centric projects invariably satisfy the aspirational needs of people and the functional needs of corporate entities.    The legacy of outstanding projects has deservedly won them, the abiding trust of its customers.    Inspired by this trust, the Shreeji Group is now spreading its wings, across one of the most vibrant and pro-development state in India-Gujarat.    The group has commenced work, on a residential project in Udwada and has ambitious plans, to cover major cities and towns, in this progressive state.    Beyond doubt, the people-centric and ambitious Shreeji Group is synonymous, with value delivery backed by trust, integrity, competency and timeliness. |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![AJMERA BOULEVARD photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"AJMERA BOULEVARD photo\")\n![Mahindra Marina64 photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mahindra Marina64 photo\")\n![Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara photo\")\n![Narang Vivenda photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Vivenda photo\")\n![Chandak Treesourus photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Chandak Treesourus photo\")\n![Ajmera Arham photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ajmera Arham photo\")\n![Lotus Sky Garden photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Lotus Sky Garden photo\")\n![Raj Infinia photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Raj Infinia photo\")\n![Liberty Bay Vue photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Liberty Bay Vue photo\")\n![Vora Centrico photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Vora Centrico photo\")\n\n## Other Projects by Shreeji Construction\n\n![Shreeji Sky Rise Tower photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Sky Rise Tower photo\")\n![Shreeji Plaza photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Plaza photo\")\n![Codename Skyrise photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Codename Skyrise photo\")\n![Shreeji Royal Samarpan photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Royal Samarpan photo\")\n![Shreeji Aspire photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Aspire photo\")\n![Shreeji Heights photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Heights photo\")\n![Sapph