sApp or Call below to speak with a Mumbai Property Exchange advisor — serving Mumbai since 1995 · RERA-registered since 2017.\n\nSOURCE · MAHARERA + MUMBAI PROPERTY EXCHANGE  \nINDEPENDENT DATA · RERA A51800043517 · EST. 1995\n\n[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Shreeji%20Eternity%20Wing%20-%20A%2C%20Shreeji%20Eternity%20Wing%20-%20B%2C%20Shreeji%20Eternity%20Wing%20-%20C%20(RERA%20P51800054310))[Enquire ▸](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Shreeji%20Eternity%20Wing%20-%20A%2C%20Shreeji%20Eternity%20Wing%20-%20B%2C%20Shreeji%20Eternity%20Wing%20-%20C%20(RERA%20P51800054310))\n\n🎯 AI Matchmaker\n\nTell us what you want in Malad West — get matched\n\nRERA-verified options on WhatsApp. No spam, no fakes.\n\n[New launch\n\nAkshar Elevate, Vashi\n\nNew launch in Vashi — ₹28,895/sq.ft\n\nView project ›](/ad-click/900045)\n\n## 📰 Latest Mumbai Property News\n\n[View all news →](/news)\n\n[![Dhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8ab151e7dd57.png)\n\nArticles\n\nDhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![BMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/a5490eaafe8c.png)\n\nArticles\n\nBMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001930/bmc-begins-fresh-sea-level-risk-assessment-for-mumbai)[![MahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/499075ce4cdd.png)\n\nArticles\n\nMahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001927/maharera-orders-l-t-to-fix-defects-at-crescent-bay-parel)[![GIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8d8e7c8b42a9.png)\n\nArticles\n\nGIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra\n\n📅 05 Sep 2026](/news/2001922/gis-maps-to-be-attached-to-sale-deeds-from-october-in-maharashtra)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shreeji-eternity/240917/project","title":"Shreeji Eternity, Malad West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹1.67 Cr Onwards | 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![The Shreeji Group developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/the-shreeji-group-1454-9742.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Shreeji Eternity Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Shreeji Eternity Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-eternity-project-project-large-image1-8638.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Shreeji Eternity Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-eternity-project-floor-plans1-1440.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Shreeji Eternity Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-eternity-project-floor-plans6-2576.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Shreeji Eternity Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shreeji-eternity-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹1.67 Cr - 3.20 Cr**\n\n₹31,900 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Shreeji Eternity?\n\n## About Shreeji Eternity, Malad West by The Shreeji Group\n\nWelcome to Shreeji Eternity, a landmark residential address in the vibrant heart of Malad West, Mumbai, where modern luxury meets timeless charm.\n\nSpread across 0.85 acres, this premium gated development features 2 & 3 BHK homes ranging from 541 to 975 sq. ft., designed with private decks, panoramic skyline views, and a rare sense of space in the city’s western corridor.\n\nComprising 159 thoughtfully crafted residences across four towers; three rising to 20 floors and one soaring to 38 floors, Shreeji Eternity is all about living elevated.\n\nWith 30,000+ sq. ft. of podium-level amenities, landscaped greens, and smart security, it blends everyday comfort with curated experiences for every age and lifestyle.\n\nAll this within a low-density layout that prioritizes privacy, airiness, and peace of mind.\n\nTop schools, hospitals, and malls are all nearby, making daily life effortless.\n\nFuture-ready connectivity translates to shorter commute times and long-term property value growth.\n\nBacked by the trusted Shreeji Group, this project brings with it over 30 years of real estate expertise and a legacy of quality across Mumbai and Nashik. Known for their thoughtful design, Shreeji has earned a reputation that gives both homebuyers and investors the confidence of long-term value and peace of mind.\n\nAt Shreeji Eternity, you don’t just buy a home; you step into a lifestyle of prestige, comfort, and future-ready living. This is where your story finds its place.\n\n## Shreeji Eternity Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Shreeji Eternity.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  540 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.67 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  685 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.12 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  762 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.50 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  975 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.20 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nShreeji Eternity's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Shreeji Eternity | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 31900 | 30550 |\n| Mar 2026 | 25150 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 26700 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 29600 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nShreeji Eternity avg. price is ₹ 31.9 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Current Project **Shreeji Eternity** | ₹ 31,900 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,550 |\n| [Chandak 34 Park Estate D Wing](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-34-park-estate-d-wing/102342/project \"Chandak 34 Park Estate D Wing\") | ₹ 30,500 |\n| [Chandak Passcode Bay Garden](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-passcode-bay-garden/30561/project \"Chandak Passcode Bay Garden\") | ₹ 30,500 |\n| [Godrej Bliss Kandivali](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/godrej-bliss-kandivali/224121/project \"Godrej Bliss Kandivali\") | ₹ 29,100 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malad West ranges from ₹ 19.9 K to ₹ 1.3 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Shreeji Eternity | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 38.3 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 62.4 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 80.4 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Shreeji Eternity.\n\nA total of 18 residential transactions has been registered so far for Shreeji Eternity, amounting to ₹ 31 Cr till September 2026.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Shreeji Eternity moved from ₹ 25,150/sqft to ₹ 31,900/sqft, reflecting a 26.84% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nStructural Works reach 78% completion, Internal finishing stands at 3%.\n\nStructural Works reach 78% completion.\n\nStructural Works reach 77% completion.\n\nStructural Works reach 77% completion.\n\nStructural Works reach 73% completion, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 12% done.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n18 Sales Transactions Registered in Shreeji Eternity From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 22.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 18 | ₹ 31 Cr | ₹ 22,800 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Shreeji Eternity Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 540 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shreeji Eternity, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shreeji-eternity-apartment-2-bhk-306sqft-20250511180502-3d-7111.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.67 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 685 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shreeji Eternity, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shreeji-eternity-apartment-2-bhk-685sqft-20250511180513-3d-9660.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.12 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 762 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shreeji Eternity, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shreeji-eternity-apartment-3-bhk-762sqft-20250511180524-3d-8509.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.50 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 975 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shreeji Eternity, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shreeji-eternity-apartment-3-bhk-975sqft-20250511180533-3d-8496.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 3.20 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Shreeji Eternity\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Shreeji Eternity to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Shreeji Eternity Master Plan 1](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-eternity-project-master-plan-image1-7920.jpg?aio=w-370;h-366;crop;)\n![Shreeji Eternity Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-eternity-project-floor-plans1-1440.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Shreeji Eternity Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-eternity-project-floor-plans6-2576.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Shreeji Eternity Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shreeji-eternity-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n### Master Plan 1\n\nShreeji Eternity is a residential project located in Malad West. The master plan illustrates a single building structure, which is divided into four distinct sections, referred to as Wing A, Wing B, Wing C, and Wing D. The plan provides detailed layouts of residential units within these wings.\n\nThe master plan for Shreeji Eternity primarily showcases the residential layout, detailing various unit configurations across its four wings. The entire footprint visible appears dedicated to the building structure, with internal corridors and individual unit spaces making up the majority of the visible area. No distinct commercial zones or large, dedicated open spaces are explicitly delineated within this plan overview.\n\nDownload brochure, master plan & walkthrough video of Shreeji Eternity to explore floor plans, layout, and complete project details in Malad West, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Expert Review\n\n![Shreeji Eternity | New Launch of 2 & 3 BHK Apartments in Link Road, Malad West | Sample Flat Tour](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fag_2hqosLk/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Shreeji Eternity - Malad West, Mumbai](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4hKpV2tuy8k/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Shreeji Eternity / BY Shreeji Group / Malad West, Mumbai / Spacious #2bhk & #3bhk For Sale #linkroad](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IE3mO2U3FU8/hqdefault.jpg)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Shreeji Eternity\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-readingr-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around The Shreeji Group Malad West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Shreeji Eternity.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Shreeji Eternity](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-eternity-project-project-large-image1-8638.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Pinnacle High International School\n\n#### Giridhar Park\n\n#### Zenith Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malad West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nBypass Road development & proposed highway\n\nAbsence of well developed public transport\n\nAndheri West appeals to me because my interactions are practical and lively. I have great colleges nearby, simple metro access, corporate offices etc. Weekends are spent at parks with family as well as at the beach. Though I adore this location, parking problems and noise have to be addressed quickly.\n\n— Smita Deo, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Shreeji Eternity\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n18 Sales Transactions Registered in Shreeji Eternity From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 22.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-04-02 | Floor 35, Unit 3502 | D | 1,217 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-31 | Floor 16, Unit 1603 | B | 594 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-27 | Floor 19, Unit 190 | A | 594 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-23 | Floor 15, Unit 1501 | B | 704 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-09 | Floor 20, Unit 2002 | B | 594 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-02-24 | Floor 8, Unit 801 | B | 704 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-01-29 | Floor 20, Unit 2001 | B | 704 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-01-28 | Floor 15, Unit 1504 | B | 594 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-01-22 | Floor 20, Unit 2002 | C | 754 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-01-13 | Floor 18, Unit 1804 | A | 594 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Shreeji Eternity compare with similar projects?\n\n![Shreeji Eternity project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shreeji-eternity-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Shreeji Eternity](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shreeji-eternity/240917/project \"Shreeji Eternity\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![JPV Pratap Palace project in Kandivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-jpv-pratap-palace-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [JPV Pratap Palace](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/jpv-pratap-palace/27097/project \"JPV Pratap Palace\")\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Chandak Passcode Bay Garden project in Goregaon West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-chandak-passcode-bay-garden-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Chandak Passcode Bay Garden](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-passcode-bay-garden/30561/project \"Chandak Passcode Bay Garden\")\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Shreeji Eternity Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Shreeji Eternity located at Malad West Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nI am drawn to Shreeji Eternity because of its location in Malad West and the variety of amenities it has. The RERA registration of the project lends credibility.\n\nOwner\n\nI really love the gym and library. It ensures a perfect combination of relaxation and activity.\n\nOwner\n\nBeing close to the mall, school, and hospital makes daily life so convenient. The location is unbeatable.\n\nOwner\n\nI was promised possession by 2027, but the deadline has been pushed to June 2028.\n\nTenant\n\nThe project feels a bit cramped with limited open spaces. I expected more greenery.\n\n## The Shreeji Group Track Record\n\n![The Shreeji Group logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/the-shreeji-group-1454-9742.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nThe Shreeji Group, a renowned real estate developer based in Mumbai, has successfully completed multiple projects and is currently working on numerous others across western India. With a commitment to meeting the diverse demands of our customers, we provide unparalleled options in luxury, affordability, and prime locations.Led by visionary leaders Mr. Nimesh Desai and Mr. Bhushan Patil, Shreeji Construction is dedicated to creating futuristic and sustainable urban spaces. The team comprises experienced engineers and an efficient administrative staff, elevating our reputation and garnering recognition. As a result, we offer 1/2/3 BHK flats at the most competitive prices in Mumbai.At Shreeji Construction, we firmly believe in building bonds of trust with our esteemed customers. We remain true to our promises and strive to fulfill their expectations sincerely and professionally. Join us in realizing your dream of owning the perfect property.\n\n![Shreeji Trinity residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-tn-shreeji-trinity-project-flagship-opt-778826.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Shreeji Nakshtra residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shreeji-nakshtra-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.04 Cr to 1.21 Cr\n\n![Shreeji Solitaire Kandivali residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shreeji-solitaire-kandivali-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.25 Cr to 2.15 Cr\n\n![Shreeji Divine Kandivali residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.