Anil Tiwari]()\n\nAuranest Realty\n\n![Manish Singh]()\n\nOm Sai Estate Agency\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Shreeji Eternity\n\n### What are the key features that set Shreeji Eternity apart from other projects in Malad West?\n\nShreeji Eternity stands out with its strategic location on New Link Road and Western Express Highway, comprehensive amenities like power backup and kids play areas, and specifications including oil bound distemper walls and vitrified tiles flooring.\n\n### What are the available unit options in Shreeji Eternity?\n\nThe project offers 2 and 3 BHK apartments with varying sizes, ranging from 306 Sq. Ft. to 975 Sq. Ft., priced between 1.48 Cr to 2.67 Cr.\n\n### Who is the developer behind Shreeji Eternity, and what is their reputation in the real estate industry?\n\nShreeji Eternity is developed by The Shreeji Group, a renowned real estate developer with 11 successful projects under their belt.\n\n### What are the nearby infrastructure developments and future growth potential of the area?\n\nThe area has excellent connectivity to New Link Road and Western Express Highway, making it an attractive location for those who desire a well-connected lifestyle.\n\n### Is Shreeji Eternity RERA-registered, and what are the RERA registration numbers?\n\nYes, Shreeji Eternity is RERA-registered, with registration numbers P51800054310 and P51800054233.\n\n### What kind of amenities and facilities can residents expect to enjoy at Shreeji Eternity?\n\nThe project offers a range of amenities, including power backup, kids play areas, indoor games, and a central green area, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable living experience.\n\n### What is the probable date of possession?\n\nThe development stage is construction phase with the project expected for June 2028 possession.\n\n### What enjoyable facilities are provided?\n\nAmenities are a gym, library, turf, landscaped gardens, and a children's play area.\n\n### How many units are there in the project?\n\nThe project Shreeji Eternity has 159 units.\n\n### Are there any nearby landmarks?\n\nThe project is proximate to schools, hospitals, malls, and other utility services.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/shreeji-eternity-in-malad-west-mumbai-pjid-46504","title":"Shreeji Eternity in Malad West, Mumbai by Shreeji Construction - RealEstateIndia.Com","raw_content":"[![RealEstateIndia.Com - India's Property Portal](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/realestateindia-logo.svg) ![RealEstateIndia.Com](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/realestateindia-icon.svg)](https://www.realestateindia.com/delhi-property/ \"RealEstateIndia.Com\")\n\nMumbai\n\nSearch from Over 2500 Cities **-** All India\n\nPOPULAR CITIES\n\n* [New Delhi](https://www.realestateindia.com/delhi-property/ \"New Delhi Property\")\n* [Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/mumbai-property/ \"Mumbai Property\")\n* [Gurgaon](https://www.realestateindia.com/gurgaon-property/ \"Gurgaon Property\")\n* [Noida](https://www.realestateindia.com/noida-property/ \"Noida Property\")\n* [Bangalore](https://www.realestateindia.com/bangalore-property/ \"Bangalore Property\")\n* [Ahmedabad](https://www.realestateindia.com/ahmedabad-property/ \"Ahmedabad Property\")\n* [Navi Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/navimumbai-property/ \"Navi Mumbai Property\")\n* [Kolkata](https://www.realestateindia.com/kolkata-property/ \"Kolkata Property\")\n* [Chennai](https://www.realestateindia.com/chennai-property/ \"Chennai Property\")\n* [Pune](https://www.realestateindia.com/pune-property/ \"Pune Property\")\n* [Greater Noida](https://www.realestateindia.com/greaternoida-property/ \"Grea