1. Where is Shreeji Construction Located?\n\n   Shreeji Construction is located in Malad West, Mumbai.\n2. What type of property can I find in Shreeji Construction?\n\n   You can easily find 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments in Shreeji Construction.\n3. What is the size of 2 BHK apartment in Shreeji Construction?\n\n   The approximate size of a 2 BHK apartment here are 541 Sq.ft., 586 Sq.ft., 640 Sq.ft., 787 Sq.ft.\n4. What is the size of 3 BHK apartment in Shreeji Construction?\n\n   The approximate size of a 3 BHK apartment here are 1205 Sq.ft., 1217 Sq.ft.\n5. What is the starting price of an apartment in Shreeji Construction?\n\n   You can find an apartment in Shreeji Construction at a starting price of 1.50 Cr..\n6. By when can I gain possession of property in Shreeji Construction?\n\n   You can get complete possession of your property here by Jun 2028.\n\n## Shreeji Eternity Get Best Offer on this Project\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n![Ekta Meadows](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh6/project2/morya-2.jpg \"Ekta Meadows\")\n\n[Ekta Meadows](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/ekta-meadows-by-ekta-shelters-pvt-ltd-in-kandivali-east-mumbai-pjid-2/)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n1.17 Cr.-1.80 Cr.\n\n1.0, 2.0 BHK Flats & Apartments\n\n![Oberoi Garden](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh6/project3/proj_img-3_3.jpg \"Oberoi Garden\")\n\n[Oberoi Garden](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/oberoi-garden-by-oberoi-realty-limited-in-kandivali-mumbai/)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n2.80 Cr.\n\n3.0 BHK Flats & Apartments\n\n![Oberoi Park View](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh6/project4/proj_img-4_2.jpg \"Oberoi Park View\")\n\n[Oberoi Park View](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/oberoi-park-view-by-oberoi-realty-limited-in-kandivali-mumbai/)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n2.55 Cr.\n\n2.0 BHK Flats & Apartments\n\n![Evershine Crown](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh6/project12/proj_img-12_1.jpg \"Evershine C