bai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n3. [Western Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-western-mumbai-mumbai)\n4. [Malad West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-malad-west-mumbai)\n5. Shreeji Eternity\n\n[![Shreeji Eternity Project Images 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/P7XwRMC3Mpmdj80XZfd5wsNKQ65t1iBNGIv4kmDk.webp)](#)\n\n[![Shreeji Eternity Project Images 2](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/CFYvMOmxr2kbdUL7T72Vjg7Sy3rplryexAafpOVK.webp)](#)\n\n[![Shreeji Eternity Project Images 3](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/uy3cjJyPSNEjqh5VyowBhiYkhevCNQpoj9HtigDa.webp)](#)\n\n\n\n## About Shreeji Eternity\n\n### Overview\n\n![Project Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/network.svg) Project Area\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) No. of Storey's\n\n0.76 Acres\n\n34 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nJuly 2028\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n* **4 Stunning Towers**\n* **Ground+1 Commercial & 4 Level Podium**\n* **Balcony Residences with Sky View**\n* **30,000+ Sq Ft. Amenities on the Podium**\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\n### **Overview – Shreeji Eternity Malad West**\n\nFinding the right home in Mumbai often comes down to balancing budget, space, and location and that’s exactly where Shreeji Eternity Malad West solves the problem. This thoughtfully planned residential development offers modern 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments, making it an ideal choice for families as well as investors looking for a promising opportunity in a growing suburb.\n\nLocated in one of the most sought-after areas, Shreeji Eternity Malad West Mumbai provides excellent connectivity to key parts of the city, including business hubs, schools, hospitals, and daily essentials. For homebuyers looking to buy property in Malad West Mumbai, this project offers the advantage of convenience along with a well-developed neighborhood. With ongoing infrastructure growth, the Malad West property price 2026 trend is expected to rise, making this a smart investment property in Malad West.\n\nOne of the biggest challenges buyers face is finding luxury apartments in Malad West Mumbai within a reasonable budget. With Shreeji Eternity price starting competitively, it becomes a strong option for those searching for flats in Malad West under 2 crore without compromising on quality or lifestyle. The project features well-designed homes with efficient layouts, ensuring maximum space utilization and comfort for modern living.\n\n**Key Highlights:**\n\n* Premium 2 BHK / 3 BHK apartments with smart layouts\n* Part of a well-planned gated community with multiple towers\n* Modern lifestyle amenities with podium and recreational spaces\n* Strategic location with excellent connectivity across Mumbai\n* Strong potential for appreciation, making it ideal for investment\n\nFor those exploring new projects in Malad West Mumbai, apartments in Shreeji Eternity offer a balanced mix of affordability, luxury, and future growth. Whether you're planning to move in or invest, Shreeji Eternity Malad West provides a solution that aligns with both lifestyle needs and financial goals.\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nShreeji Eternity brochure\n\n## Pricing of Shreeji Eternity\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [2 BHK Apartment](#tabs-5)\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n\n* [541 sqft](#tabs-4108)\n* [586 sqft](#tabs-4109)\n* [640 sqft](#tabs-4110)\n* [685 sqft](#tabs-4111)\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 541 sqft | Price:  ₹ 1.62 Cr\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 586 sqft | Price:  ₹ 1.58 Cr\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 640 sqft | Price:  ₹ 1.73 Cr\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 685 sqft | Price:  ₹ 1.85 Cr\n\n* [1205 sqft](#tabs-4112)\n* [1217 sqft](#tabs-4113)\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1205 sqft | Price:  ₹ 3.92 Cr\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1217 sqft | Price:  ₹ 3.96 Cr\n\n## Property Features of Shreeji Eternity\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Banquet Hall](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/nVnv7aXBAjY7xGCOJG6gfa3JfUAOKFn4ktPtHEG8.webp) Banquet Hall\n\n* ![Club house](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/XHmlGOsa5pmWAop1jsrzbhwfyh0ZziFBsDDydKHm.webp) Club house\n\n* ![Jogging Track](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/0MdcVu1dWQscKGxYPlOEvfKZG17sbpLwkkWHGQus.webp) Jogging Track\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/caC1nd4EG3aPxrSHSy42KOuI69993uXqnhmO5wM1.webp) Kids Play Area\n\n* ![Jacuzzi](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/gcqIpryLKPtTmLYZLBqVzLdqa8EmUyorq7Df5y0O.webp) Jacuzzi\n\n* ![Yoga Zone](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/COwM5RjENyf7U7nEW3taZHaXwLNwUKHFpeE88skI.webp) Yoga Zone\n\n* ![Gym](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/IGXHlscIm9ZRf5Dwqaa7fOuHpxoQXC8VN6qHvSos.webp) Gym\n\n* ![Library](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/Jp0cuZ70Q5hsq1SGammSIKq1zy4LwCVSDxqaH5n2.webp) Library\n\n---\n\n### Facilities\n\n* ![Lift](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/PlsX6Ye4mz30wZTyU2HUzRfZZAF1UyAfAPcv7UW6.webp) Lift\n\n* ![Gas Pipeline](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/77fRi35ugy3nBpLGvEFZIc9Nzx43eeLJEWJkzUuI.webp) Gas Pipeline\n\n* ![Power Back Up](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/hyhD5ZsEryAKGW3ZBDuJfwfIbR00KY59KGRA3TdM.webp) Power Back Up\n\n* ![Security System](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/6dsfc7xPvlsYjnrmZXSMQCe0h9jTiIuqmb3G3wvM.webp) Security System\n\n* ![Washroom](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/0acAwKjwxSj6Xx5mRLWVuU1BHIoQLPyqdjxlIxfN.webp) Washroom\n\n* ![24*7 Water](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/8r8bjKftbO1sSY8rBawv8AexZBpGB5Yes5BaCx4g.png) 24\\*7 Water\n\n* ![Gated Society](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/dDrSaKbMFrQab5ychFhoq4q88iDVDHgsAU0z9gxn.webp) Gated Society\n\n## Bank Offers\n\n![About Keystone Real Estate Advisory](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/ks/images/home-loan-banner.webp)  [Contact Us Now](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/contact)\n\n![Aditya Birla Capital](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/XGrM42hFHDybp1Y19862M4OyJ8gDOsg3EE9GTEB1.webp) 8.00% - 13.00%\n\n![Axis Bank Home Loan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/QZdtxvhynBtBOc30oXZBnWVc5XQBY2AurKebGOt2.webp) 7.60% - 8.05%\n\n![Bajaj Finserv](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/AXQcBE3UdCXzDqCrUfdYix4bnsRarkLpNFpY10H8.webp) 7.70% - 14.00%\n\n![Bank of Baroda](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/6MLWA1aTbSguKjxxqZVVnPer7FyazH85YXJv5wKD.webp) 7.45% - 8.80%\n\n![Citi Bank](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/LHciFR3ExZu3X7BihADb9fpp